WEBVTT

NOTE
The walkthrough has no sound: these are the captions shown on screen, with their timings.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
UnderCover: AI agents for travel insurance claims, end to end

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
First, the customer's side

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
1 · Customer portal

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Wattle answers from the customer's own policy and cites its sources

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Making a claim: a receipt is enough

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Wattle reads the receipt and drafts the claim

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The customer checks the draft, fixes anything wrong, and sends it

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Sent. The customer can follow it from here

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Next, the claims team

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
2 · Handlers' dashboard

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
A handler sends the claim agents to work the waiting claims

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:26.000
The agent screens the claim for hidden instructions, then checks the policy and the documents

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Its recommendation, with its reasons and the sources it relied on

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.000
It spots the same receipt on an earlier claim, and refers this one to a person

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Larger payouts always wait for a person

00:01:47.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Wattle briefs the handler on any claim, with the handler's own access

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Larger payouts always wait for a person

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.000
A senior handler signs off, and the customer is paid

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Last, the engineers who keep the AI honest

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.000
3 · AI assurance console

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Every version of the agent is scored against claims experts' decisions

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:29.000
An improver agent proposes changes. Nothing ships until an engineer approves

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:39.000
A red team attacks the agent with fraud and hidden instructions

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Each OWASP risk is mapped to a control and the attacks that test it

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:59.000
And every decision is traced: each step, model call and cent

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.000
UnderCover: customers, claims experts and AI engineers, one system
